      "c:\\Users\\aifadmin\\Documents\\Github\\autoSCAPE\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\biaplotter\\colormap.py:34: UserWarning: Categorical colormap detected. Setting categorical=True. If the colormap is continuous, set categorical=False explicitly.\n",
